      "id": "claim_7a762a2aae354a968b13717fd11d971b",
      "statement": "Profile activation is controlled externally, not via spring.profiles.active in properties files: Docker uses -Dspring.profiles.active=prod (JVM argument), while IDE/local runs use --spring.profiles.active or the SPRING_PROFILES_ACTIVE environment variable.",
